    <informations>Shelly 1 Gen3 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O I SW 12V L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_9246ac9275172ffc65970d9628bba0fe0baa2060811077b79a840043b467246c/Shelly%201%20Gen3.jpg?cb=c1cd97bb5c2c8a5f201320734f8b2a52
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_7cfa072bb2d0dc6f7486b92b170168c364d63b9cb02f103f7d9250bf37fff728/Plus-1-internal-schematics.png?cb=859b7ac75c9af8b5572057a91fe4196a
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_6bfb37014f1b867ef09949f5094c6183296deefc7957ce7efd692fdb0a0682b4/Shelly%201%20Gen3%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=b437adea152e764e37ccf7051c0bd1ab

Notes:
- Same six actual terminal positions as Plus 1, including 12V. Blank pitch2.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
